    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45321" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτρᾰπελ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ready wit, liveliness</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				563a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
				28.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				7.32.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.6
			</span></i>: pl., <i>pleasantries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				177
			</span></i>; defined by <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπαιδευμένη ὕβρις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
