			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1108a24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ τὰς παιδιὰς καὶ τὰς
				ὁμιλίας εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely in bad
			sense, 
